{"total": 31.45, "scenes": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 4.8, "html": "<div class='shot' data-in='0'><img src='{{IMG:/home/claude/qsalon-reels/mon/v4/broll1.jpg}}'></div><div class='eyebrow' data-in='0.1'>Confidence Monday</div><div class='h md' data-in='0.4'>The best-groomed men don't get more haircuts.</div><div class='h md gold' data-in='3.05'>They get them on time.</div>"}, {"start": 4.8, "end": 10.9, "html": "<div class='row' style='align-items:flex-end'><div class='unit' data-in='0.1' style='padding-bottom:60px'>Week</div><div class='big' data-in='0.15' data-count='5'>5</div></div><div class='p' data-in='1.3'>The shape is gone.</div><div class='p' data-in='3.1'>The sides puff out.</div><div class='p gold' data-in='4.35'>The hat comes out.</div>"}, {"start": 10.9, "end": 20.9, "html": "<div class='eyebrow' data-in='0'>How long a cut holds</div><div class='barrow' data-in='0.25'><div class='lab'><span>Short cut</span><b>3\u20134 weeks</b></div><div class='track'><i data-in='0.45' data-bar='0.5'></i></div></div><div class='barrow' data-in='4.1'><div class='lab'><span>Longer style</span><b>5\u20136 weeks</b></div><div class='track'><i data-in='4.3' data-bar='0.78'></i></div></div><div class='h md' data-in='7.0'>Book your next one before you leave the chair.</div>"}, {"start": 20.9, "end": 25.5, "html": "<div class='shot tall' data-in='0'><img src='{{IMG:/home/claude/qsalon-reels/mon/v4/kris_man.jpg}}' style='object-position:50% 30%'></div><div class='h' data-in='0.3'>No more bad hair weeks.</div><div class='p' data-in='2.2'>And it shows in how you walk into a room.</div>"}, {"start": 25.5, "end": 31.45, "html": "<div class='photo' data-in='0.1'><img src='{{SUSY}}'></div><div class='h md' data-in='0.2'>Set a standing appointment with Susy.</div><div class='chip' data-in='2.55'>Book \u00b7 link in bio</div><div class='handle' data-in='2.85'>@theqsalon_srq</div>"}]}